          "text_edits": [
            {
              "from": "3. **Ask before removing a dependency.** Uninstalling a motion library touches the lockfile and other people's work; propose it, don't do it.",
              "to": "3. **Remove unused dependencies within the authorized cleanup.** First check all consumers in the relevant package or workspace, including configuration and build scripts. If the dependency is now unused and cleanup is part of the request, remove it with the project's package manager and update its lockfile. Ask only when ownership, scope, or continued use is genuinely uncertain."
            },
